Tagline:
“Emergency Help, Just One Tap Away.”

Description:
Sauyo Rescue is a community-focused emergency response app designed for Barangay Sauyo, connecting residents with authorized barangay responders during medical emergencies, fires, accidents, disasters, and other urgent situations. With one-tap emergency requests, location sharing, real-time response tracking, and responder communication, Sauyo Rescue is still in beta testing as we continue improving the app and making emergency communication faster, clearer, and more organized.
